subtitle t-section-subtitle t-section-subtitle--big" > Breathe in the fresh air and lose yourself in the tranquility of our lush gardens and skywalk that winds through our beautiful tree canopy. </div> </div> </div> </section> </div><div data-component-id='21496371' > <section class="l-section l-section--attractions-slider"> <div class="l-wrapper l-wrapper--attractions-slider"> <div class="attractions-slider "> <div class="attractions-slider__col attractions-slider__col--content"> <div class="attractions-slider__content-box "> <h2 class="attractions-slider__title t-section-title wa-headline-font js-shuffle-element-title" > Experiences </h2> <p class="attractions-slider__subtitle t-section-subtitle" > Craft your perfect itinerary with our hand-picked curated experiences. </p> <div class="attractions-slider__btn-hld"> <a class="attractions-slider__btn btn-link wa-primary-color wa-secondary-color--hover" href='/experiences' target='_self' > <span class="text " > VIEW ALL </span> </a> </div> </div> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="glee-decor" width="9" height="49" viewBox="0 0 9 49" fill="none"> <line x1="4.5" y1="48.3853" x2="4.5" y2="7.38525" stroke="#917248"/> <line x1="0.5" y1="41.3853" x2="0.500002" y2="0.385254" stroke="#917248"/> <line x1="8.5" y1="41.3853" x2="8.5" y2="0.385254" stroke="#917248"/> </svg> </div> <div class="attractions-slider__col attractions-slider__col--slider"> <div class="attractions-slider__slider-box js-attractions-slider-holder"> <div class="attractions-slider__slider-wrapper"> <div class="attractions-slider__slider-holder"> <div class="attractions-slider__swiper-button attractions-slider__swiper-button--prev js-swiper-button-prev btn-slider wa-primary-color--hover "> <span class="icon icon-arrow-left"></span> </div> <div dir="rtl" class="attractions-slider__container swiper-container js-attractions-slider"> <div class="swiper-wrapper"> <a class="attractions-slider-item-without-hover attractions-slider-item-without-hover--sli